ADR-01
Support both online and in person tutoring sessions
Online sessions only; online and in person sessions
Supporting both gives students more flexibility, but requires handling two session formats

ADR-02
Use in app mock notifications to inform students and tutors about new tutoring requests, request decisions ,confirmed sessions, and upcoming sessions
In-app mock notifications; real email notifications
In app mock notifications allow users to view important updates within the platform without requiring real email delivery. However, users will not receive actual email notifications outside the platform.

ADR-03
Confirm a session only after tutor acceptance and successful booking policy checks
Confirm the session immediately after the student submits a request; confirm it after tutor acceptance and policy validation
This prevents invalid bookings and scheduling conflicts, but adds steps before a session is confirmed
